{%- comment -%}
  HOUSE OF AGHA — opening ritual, part 2 of 2: the overlay (rendered once, first thing in <body>, homepage only).
  Hidden unless html.hoa-intro-active is set (snippets/hoa-intro-head.liquid). assets/hoa-intro.js animates it:
  the blueprint line drawing of the bottle appears, the cap is pressed, a fine mist crosses the screen and uncovers the wordmark, then the
  overlay lifts into the homepage hero. The drawing is drawn twice (cap / body) so only the cap moves.
  The wordmark text below is what the canvas reproduces, and what travels to the hero at the end.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="hoa-intro" data-hoa-intro aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="hoa-intro__stage">
    <div class="hoa-intro__bottle" data-intro-bottle>
      <div class="hoa-intro__float" data-intro-float>
        <img class="hoa-intro__body" data-intro-body src="{{ 'hoa-bottle-blueprint.svg' | asset_url }}" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="" width="1200" height="1500" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
        <img class="hoa-intro__cap" data-intro-cap src="{{ 'hoa-bottle-blueprint.svg' | asset_url }}" crossorigin="anonymous" alt="" width="1200" height="1500" decoding="async">
      </div>
    </div>
    <canvas class="hoa-intro__mist" data-intro-canvas></canvas>
    <p class="hoa-intro__mark" data-intro-mark>House of Agha</p>
  </div>
  <button type="button" class="hoa-intro__skip" data-intro-skip aria-hidden="false" tabindex="0">Skip</button>
</div>
